{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/292","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/292/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/292/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/292/events","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/292","id":189577504,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxODk1Nzc1MDQ=","number":292,"title":"COFFFileReader::read_lib() fails on poorly generated yet correct .lib files","user":{"login":"jjcamp","id":6845015,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4NDUwMTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6845015?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjcamp","html_url":"https://github.com/jjcamp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjcamp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjcamp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjcamp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjcamp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjcamp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjcamp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjcamp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjcamp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjcamp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":453053596,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0NTMwNTM1OTY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/labels/category:vcpkg-bug","name":"category:vcpkg-bug","color":"ff3333","default":false,"description":"The issue is with the vcpkg system (including helper scripts in `scripts/cmake/`)"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"alexkaratarakis","id":128712,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODcxMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128712?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis","html_url":"https://github.com/alexkaratarakis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"alexkaratarakis","id":128712,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODcxMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128712?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis","html_url":"https://github.com/alexkaratarakis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2016-11-16T03:48:01Z","updated_at":"2016-11-18T21:42:09Z","closed_at":"2016-11-18T21:39:15Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"*By correct, I mean that they can be used without error.  The PE spec doesn't seem to cover this case.*\r\n\r\nSynopsis\r\n---\r\nThe `COFFFileReader::read_lib()` function currently reads the number of [archive] members from the second linker data member.  It then uses that number to loop through the remaining archive members and verify their headers.\r\n\r\nHowever, it is apparently possible for some of those member to have offsets which point to 0.  When this happens, **vcpkg** will continue reading the `std::fstream` past EOF, and will end up calling exiting when `COFFFileReader::verify_equal_strings()` fails.\r\n\r\nExample\r\n---\r\nWhen installing  `pdcurses:x86-windows`, vcpkg fails with error:\r\n```\r\nIncorrect string (LIB HEADER_END) found. Expected: `\\n but found \r\n```\r\nThis is because the second archive member claims there are 479 members, and there are in fact 479 member *offsets*.  This is the end of dumpbin's member offset table:\r\n```\r\n      1D1    133F6\r\n      1D2    14224\r\n      1D3    142F0\r\n      1D4        0\r\n      1D5        0\r\n      1D6        0\r\n      1D7        0\r\n      1D8        0\r\n      1D9        0\r\n      1DA        0\r\n      1DB        0\r\n      1DC        0\r\n      1DD        0\r\n      1DE        0\r\n      1DF        0\r\n```\r\nThis makes it so that the second linker member data section is technically correct, but there are actually only 467 remaining archive members.\r\n\r\nReproduced on two similar 64-bit Windows 10 Anniversity Update machines, each with VS2015 update 3.\r\n\r\nPossible Fixes\r\n---\r\n- Use the second linker member's offset table to iterate over the archive members (difficult because it would require moving backwards in the file stream)\r\n- Use the second linker member's offset table to count the number of archive members without an offset of 0.\r\n- Check for `ios::eofbit` when reading the file stream.\r\n- Patch link.exe (if this is undesirable behavior)","closed_by":{"login":"alexkaratarakis","id":128712,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODcxMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128712?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis","html_url":"https://github.com/alexkaratarakis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexkaratarakis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/292/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/292/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}